OL,3,GNEWSAWales needs budget boost, says
OL,4,Afinance minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government is facing its
OL,7,Fworst settlement since before the
OL,8,Fpandemic unless it gets a cash boost in
OL,9,FWednesday's budget, finance minister
OL,10,FElin Jones has warned.
OL,12,FShe said the money for day-to-day
OL,13,Fspending next year in things like
OL,14,Fhealth and education was looking at a
OL,15,Freal-terms cut of 0.7%.
OL,17,FLlanelli's Labour MP Dame Nia Griffith
OL,18,Furged the chancellor to relax
OL,19,Frestrictions on ministers in Cardiff
OL,20,Fborrowing for investment.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
